    "model_answer": "The provided documents do not contain enough evidence to confirm that HAM/TSP patients produce Immunoglobulin G (IgG) antibodies which cross-react with an immunodominant epitope in Tax. \n\nAlthough Document 1 mentions that antibodies to hnRNP-A1 cross-reacted with HTLV-1-tax, it does not specifically state that these are IgG antibodies. Therefore, the",
