    "model_answer": "The evidence is insufficient to determine which genes are regulated by TRalpha2 in the heart. The documents provided do not contain specific information about the genes regulated by TRalpha2 in the heart. While some documents mention TRalpha2 and its role in the heart, they do not provide a list of specific genes regulated by TRalpha2. Therefore, it is not possible to provide a definitive answer to this",
    "selected_doc_ids": "[\"bioasq_11731613\", \"bioasq_18031713\", \"bioasq_10613047\", \"bioasq_15831522\", \"bioasq_17726868\", \"bioasq_17039265\", \"bioasq_24819634\", \"bioasq_21606163\"]",
