    "model_answer": "The origin of HEp-2 cells is not directly mentioned in the provided documents. However, it's clear that they are used in various studies related to cancer, photodynamic therapy, fungicide effects, and chromosome replication. But the documents do not provide enough evidence to determine where HEp-2 cells originally come from or how they were first isolated.",
    "selected_doc_ids": "[\"bioasq_25658113\", \"bioasq_26728715\", \"bioasq_32384969\", \"bioasq_32409089\", \"bioasq_30702281\", \"bioasq_23809990\", \"bioasq_22265405\", \"bioasq_24656819\"]",
